@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "12 Week Recomp — Build Your Stack";
}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>12 Week Recomp — Build Your Stack</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/welcome-lab-v1012.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/welcome-lab-art-v1012.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="wl-page">
<header class="wl-topbar">
    <a class="wl-brand" href="/welcome-lab">12 WEEK <em>RECOMP</em></a>
    <a class="wl-back" href="/welcome-lab">← All concepts</a>
    <a class="wl-cta-mini" href="/trial/start">Build Your 12 Weeks</a>
</header>
<main class="wl-card-stage">
    <div class="wl-float-orb a"></div><div class="wl-float-orb b"></div>
    <div class="wl-card-title">
        <p class="wl-kicker">CONCEPT C · DRAG THE CARDS INTO YOUR ORDER</p>
        <h1>BUILD YOUR <span>STACK.</span></h1>
        <p>Less lecture. Four visual ideas. Drag them around and make the system feel like yours.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="wl-card-grid" data-reorder-grid>
        <article class="wl-card c1" style="--accent:#19dfff">
            <div class="photo"></div><div class="shade"></div>
            <div class="body"><span class="num">01 · BREAK</span><h2>BREAK THE LOOP</h2><p>Stop repeating the same cycle of extremes, guilt and restart.</p><span class="go">CUT THE NOISE →</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="wl-card c2" style="--accent:#7cff22">
            <div class="photo"></div><div class="shade"></div>
            <div class="body"><span class="num">02 · BUILD</span><h2>TRAIN FOR MORE</h2><p>Strength, muscle and capacity change what your body can do.</p><span class="go">BUILD THE SIGNAL →</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="wl-card c3" style="--accent:#ffd83d">
            <div class="photo"></div><div class="shade"></div>
            <div class="body"><span class="num">03 · FUEL</span><h2>EAT TO PERFORM</h2><p>Protein high. Carbs with purpose. Enough food to train and recover.</p><span class="go">FUEL THE WORK →</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="wl-card c4" style="--accent:#a05cff">
            <div class="photo"></div><div class="shade"></div>
            <div class="body"><span class="num">04 · ASCEND</span><h2>LIVE STRONGER</h2><p>Build momentum that reaches past the gym and into the rest of your life.</p><span class="go">CLAIM THE NEXT WIN →</span></div>
        </article>
    </section>
    <div class="wl-actions" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:24px"><a class="wl-btn primary" href="/trial/start">Start the rebuild →</a><a class="wl-btn secondary" href="/welcome-lab/ascend">Try borderless →</a></div>
    <nav class="wl-dock" style="position:fixed" aria-label="Concept navigation"><a href="/welcome-lab/break-free">Poster</a><a href="/welcome-lab/hotspots">Hotspots</a><a href="/welcome-lab/cards">Cards</a><a href="/welcome-lab/ascend">Ascend</a></nav>
</main>
<script src="~/js/welcome-lab-v1012.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
</body>
</html>